       }
      ],
      "text": "V.:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " thin wall, compressible under the transducer, ⍉pulsatile, low-velocity cont flow w resp variation; flow increases w a dist limb squeeze."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
